1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:40,780
=Episode 9=

5
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:56,879
I don't believe you
won't sleep all night.

6
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:00,640
I couldn't sleep anyway.

7
00:02:02,439 --> 00:02:03,680
Why couldn't you sleep?

8
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:05,840
There are many things

9
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,159
I need to ask Deputy Yu.

10
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,800
I don't believe you
would stab me with a spear.

11
00:02:19,152 --> 00:02:20,310
I don't believe it, either.

12
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:24,520
But whatever Deputy Yu orders, you do?

13
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:30,000
I am Deputy Yu's soldier.

14
00:02:33,319 --> 00:02:34,479
You're amazing.

15
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,719
The General is my superior,

16
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:40,840
and Deputy Yu is my brother.

17
00:02:42,784 --> 00:02:44,710
If the General and Deputy Yu
order me to die,

18
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:45,919
I die.

19
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:51,080
Still, I don't believe you
would stab me with a spear.

20
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,479
Burning so much dry grass?

21
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:06,560
This is enchanting grass

22
00:03:06,592 --> 00:03:08,430
my guy brought over
from the Western Regions.

23
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,759
Burn it all up.

24
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:30,719
What are they doing?

25
00:03:31,439 --> 00:03:33,000
They are people who bury Tie Futu.

26
00:03:33,376 --> 00:03:34,960
Luckily, there was a merchant caravan,

27
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:36,719
so I asked them for help.

28
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:39,680
You can get people to help bury bodies?

29
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:42,560
For two camels and two bags of salt,

30
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:46,199
people would even help bury the living.

31
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,919
You don't want the salt and camels?

32
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:53,120
At daybreak,
I must hurry to kill my guy.

33
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,759
Taking camels is too slow.

34
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,639
Who are you?

35
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,919
You arrived late during the day.

36
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:13,168
Wasn't everyone looking
for the guardians of the gold?

37
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,040
They found?

38
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,079
I am one.

39
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:25,600
Bana from the camel-horse market
at Lieyang Well is one, too.

40
00:04:26,439 --> 00:04:29,360
He and his son were captured by
Deputy Military Commissioner Yu.

41
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:31,399
I have to rush over to kill him.

42
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:33,639
However, I don't know

43
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:37,000
if I can actually bring myself to do it.

44
00:04:38,144 --> 00:04:40,190
I couldn't bring myself
to do it during the day.

45
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:59,240
Are there really 300,000 taels of gold?

46
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,399
Those 300,000 taels of gold

47
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:06,319
were buried by Koke Temur,
Right Chancellor of Yuan.

48
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:10,360
Koke-what?

49
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,800
The Right Chancellor's
Han name was Wang Baobao.

50
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:14,680
In the 28th year of Zhizheng,

51
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,160
which was the first year of Hongwu,

52
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,720
Emperor Taizu captured Dadu.

53
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,560
The Right Chancellor

54
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:22,920
suffered a crushing defeat at Taiyuan,

55
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:27,160
escaping to Gansu with only 18 riders.

56
00:05:28,759 --> 00:05:29,680
Bana, myself,

57
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,920
and 16 other guys

58
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,439
were those 18 riders.

59
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,319
Only a year later,

60
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:36,639
in the second year of Hongwu,

61
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:39,720
the Right Chancellor gathered 100,000
elite troops to besiege Lanzhou,

62
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:44,279
ordering us to bury
those 300,000 taels of gold

63
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,160
for future grand plans.

64
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:49,480
We became guardians of the gold

65
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:51,040
that very year.

66
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,360
But why didn't the Right Chancellor

67
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,439
come back to retrieve the gold?

68
00:06:00,079 --> 00:06:01,480
In the third year of Hongwu,

69
00:06:02,256 --> 00:06:04,870
Wang Baobao suffered
a massive defeat and fled to Karakorum.

70
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,199
In the eighth year of Hongwu,

71
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,439
he passed away.

72
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:25,000
Your guy was captured,

73
00:06:25,759 --> 00:06:27,920
yet you're rushing over to kill him?

74
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:32,680
He wants to take Liangzhou Deputy
to the Right Chancellor's gold.

75
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,839
Deputy Military Commissioner
Yu Hou of Liangzhou.

76
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:41,680
Do you want to know where the gold is

77
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,199
now, too?

78
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,319
No.

79
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,360
Then, I won't have to kill you.

80
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:59,000
Are we still friends?

81
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:03,680
Go to Wusu Sea.

82
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:06,519
My yurt will be your yurt.

83
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:09,360
My friend,

84
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:12,600
I'm not interested
in that gold right now.

85
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:16,519
But it's not because I'm afraid of you.

86
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,480
I know.

87
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,519
He's gone!

88
00:09:05,279 --> 00:09:06,279
He's gone!

89
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:07,919
He's gone!

90
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:08,759
He left!

91
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,480
- Who's gone?
- Who left?

92
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,200
He's gone.

93
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,159
It's the kid.

94
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:12,960
His kid.

95
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,159
Keep an eye on him.

96
00:09:15,279 --> 00:09:16,960
Hurry, follow Deputy Yu and pursue.

97
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:17,639
Fang.

98
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:18,600
Quick.

99
00:09:19,639 --> 00:09:20,879
Follow Deputy Yu, quick.

100
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,159
What are you staring at? Don't move.

101
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,039
Fang!

102
00:09:30,399 --> 00:09:31,919
- Fang!
- Fang!

103
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:32,799
Fang.

104
00:09:33,919 --> 00:09:35,360
- Fang!
- Fang!

105
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,360
Fang.

106
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,679
Fang.

107
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,519
Search everywhere.

108
00:09:52,879 --> 00:09:54,039
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

109
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,679
Fang!

110
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,799
Run again, and I'll kill you.

111
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,670
I don't believe you will.

112
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,039
Fang.

113
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:50,919
Help me.

114
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:52,639
Chase. Quick, chase him!

115
00:10:52,799 --> 00:10:53,360
All right.

116
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:05,480
Father...

117
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,200
Shut up.

118
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,200
There's no outsider here.

119
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,080
Hurry, go.

120
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:26,759
Son,

121
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,080
go.

122
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,720
Go where?

123
00:11:33,519 --> 00:11:35,200
As far away as possible.

124
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,000
What about you?

125
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,679
Hurry, go.

126
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:33,120
Deputy Military Commissioner!

127
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:05,639
Hou,

128
00:13:06,656 --> 00:13:09,424
you didn't say it'd turn out like this
on Liangzhou's city wall.

129
00:13:12,279 --> 00:13:14,360
I'm asking you, Deputy.

130
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:18,600
Where's the kid?

131
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,279
I don't know.

132
00:13:23,279 --> 00:13:24,480
You dare disobey orders?

133
00:13:27,559 --> 00:13:29,440
I'll go kill him myself.

134
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:30,320
I'll go.

135
00:13:30,519 --> 00:13:31,919
I'll go kill him now.

136
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:34,600
Father.

137
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,840
He's dead!

138
00:13:40,679 --> 00:13:42,000
You might as well die, too!

139
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,279
Tie them both up.

140
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:48,416
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

141
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:16,720
What is this?

142
00:14:18,799 --> 00:14:19,799
Yellow pea cake.

143
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:23,200
Made from the best peas in Eastern Shu.

144
00:14:26,039 --> 00:14:27,879
Pingping was carrying it on her back.

145
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,159
After everything's over,

146
00:14:59,184 --> 00:15:00,656
go back to Northern Shu's Tang Clan?

147
00:15:05,879 --> 00:15:07,159
If I go back to the Tang Clan,

148
00:15:08,919 --> 00:15:10,960
I'll be like a scorpion,
a centipede, or a lizard.

149
00:15:13,519 --> 00:15:15,519
Before, Pingping treated me as a human.

150
00:15:28,528 --> 00:15:30,030
Five years ago, when I got married,

151
00:15:31,679 --> 00:15:33,720
I fell off a cliff
while crossing the Shu Road.

152
00:15:35,279 --> 00:15:37,039
It took me three days to climb back up.

153
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,630
By the time I reached the Tang Clan,

154
00:15:39,919 --> 00:15:41,519
I had become a cripple.

155
00:15:42,399 --> 00:15:43,960
So they used me as a poison tester.

156
00:15:44,416 --> 00:15:45,910
They tested all kinds of poison on me.

157
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:48,879
I went through living heck.

158
00:15:50,879 --> 00:15:51,759
Why?

159
00:15:53,159 --> 00:15:54,720
Didn't you marry into the Tang Clan?

160
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:58,320
It was my betrothed
who tested poisons on me.

161
00:15:59,559 --> 00:16:01,679
He was born a cripple
and wanted to be like you.

162
00:16:06,944 --> 00:16:08,480
After three years of testing poisons,

163
00:16:09,519 --> 00:16:11,200
going through living heck many times,

164
00:16:12,639 --> 00:16:14,240
I was no longer crippled,

165
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,399
but he still couldn't move.

166
00:16:17,088 --> 00:16:19,270
The yin energy in his body
grew heavier and heavier.

167
00:16:19,279 --> 00:16:20,360
It was like...

168
00:16:21,279 --> 00:16:23,000
Like a transparent person.

169
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,519
I saw him.

170
00:16:33,039 --> 00:16:33,919
Impossible.

171
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,399
At Heisong Post,

172
00:16:37,759 --> 00:16:39,600
when I went to the second floor
to talk to you,

173
00:16:40,176 --> 00:16:42,360
a transparent person
was right outside your door.

174
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,639
He vanished in the blink of an eye.

175
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:51,440
Maybe my eyes were playing tricks on me.

176
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,480
Then, Tie Futu showed up.

177
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,680
You saw wrong.

178
00:17:07,039 --> 00:17:08,480
He's still a cripple,

179
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,119
unable to move.

180
00:17:19,279 --> 00:17:20,640
Is the yellow pea cake good?

181
00:17:27,799 --> 00:17:29,400
Everything comes to an end eventually.

182
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:31,030
If you won't return to the Tang Clan,

183
00:17:31,039 --> 00:17:31,920
where will you go?

184
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:38,119
What counts as an end?

185
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:40,759
Tie Futu won't get away.

186
00:17:41,839 --> 00:17:43,680
All land under heaven
belongs to the King.

187
00:17:47,759 --> 00:17:49,079
You will catch him and kill him?

188
00:17:52,079 --> 00:17:53,640
Too many people have died already.

189
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:56,799
Bring him to justice...

190
00:17:57,839 --> 00:17:59,119
Whose justice?

191
00:18:01,232 --> 00:18:03,270
Gansu is a major
stronghold in the Northwest,

192
00:18:03,270 --> 00:18:04,890
with twelve guards and four battalions.

193
00:18:06,039 --> 00:18:06,880
With one order,

194
00:18:07,279 --> 00:18:08,480
thousands of troops

195
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:10,030
and assassin mercenaries respond.

196
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:11,960
What if

197
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:14,830
it was the Commander-in-Chief

198
00:18:14,839 --> 00:18:17,119
who murdered and robbed
for those 300,000 taels of gold?

199
00:18:17,359 --> 00:18:18,240
Impossible.

200
00:18:22,912 --> 00:18:25,000
You can't go to Ganzhou
just for this minor affair

201
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:25,880
of my family.

202
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:29,119
You can't see the General

203
00:18:29,119 --> 00:18:30,960
and ask why he murdered and robbed.

204
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:34,240
You can't say to the General

205
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:36,000
that all land

206
00:18:36,559 --> 00:18:37,880
under heaven belongs to the King.

207
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:40,920
Can't I?

208
00:18:45,728 --> 00:18:47,920
I'll go ask Bancha if he
wants some yellow pea cake.

209
00:19:28,079 --> 00:19:29,119
Delicious.

210
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:33,400
You never knew

211
00:19:34,279 --> 00:19:36,079
that your guy had a son?

212
00:19:37,119 --> 00:19:38,680
My men only know

213
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:40,680
that Bana has a boy named Seventeen.

214
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:44,799
Actually, you knew
that Seventeen is his son.

215
00:19:47,279 --> 00:19:48,799
Really delicious.

216
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:58,960
You can't kill Bana.

217
00:20:02,119 --> 00:20:03,559
It's a piece of cake.

218
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:05,559
I mean,

219
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:06,920
you

220
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:09,359
can't kill Bana.

221
00:20:14,279 --> 00:20:16,279
Kill whoever tries to find the gold.

222
00:20:16,839 --> 00:20:18,400
Kill as many as there are.

223
00:20:18,839 --> 00:20:20,240
Even if thousands of troops come,

224
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,279
charge at them.

225
00:20:22,519 --> 00:20:24,480
That's what the Right Chancellor
said at the time.

226
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:27,079
Right Chancellor?

227
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,559
Wang Baobao.

228
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,440
So that's how it is.

229
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:38,200
You are a warrior
of the Yuan's Right Chancellor,

230
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:40,720
Koke Temur.

231
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:46,720
You're quite smart.

232
00:20:47,319 --> 00:20:48,640
You know everything.

233
00:20:53,359 --> 00:20:54,920
Since you are in a hurry to kill,

234
00:20:55,264 --> 00:20:57,070
why don't you travel through the night?

235
00:21:02,799 --> 00:21:05,160
The dead souls here
need someone to see them off.

236
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:07,440
I will set off when the fire goes out.

237
00:21:07,759 --> 00:21:08,759
I will make it in time.

238
00:21:22,519 --> 00:21:24,160
I've met three types of people.

239
00:21:26,279 --> 00:21:27,559
The first type is good people.

240
00:21:29,039 --> 00:21:30,359
The second type is evil people.

241
00:21:32,279 --> 00:21:33,519
The third type

242
00:21:34,519 --> 00:21:36,640
is good people turning into evil ones.

243
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:45,000
But I don't know which type you are.

244
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,720
I will only know when I die.

245
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,960
Good people go to heaven,

246
00:21:52,559 --> 00:21:54,160
and evil people go to the underworld.

247
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:59,000
Have you been at the Wusu Sea
for the past 30 years?

248
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:03,359
There is no better place in the world
than the Wusu Sea.

249
00:22:05,519 --> 00:22:06,519
How good is it?

250
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:12,880
It's just like heaven.

251
00:22:23,359 --> 00:22:24,559
I really want to go.

252
00:22:26,200 --> 00:22:27,599
You can go, too.

253
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:30,240
Good people go to heaven.

254
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:34,920
Can I ask a favor of you?

255
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:36,519
Sure.

256
00:22:39,839 --> 00:22:41,640
If a fight breaks out at Shiquan Fort,

257
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:44,119
let Fang live.

258
00:22:46,039 --> 00:22:46,839
Okay.

259
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,920
Tell him that Pingping went to heaven.

260
00:22:51,599 --> 00:22:52,680
Tell him

261
00:22:53,599 --> 00:22:55,400
to stop believing in their General.

262
00:23:00,839 --> 00:23:02,240
Where do you want to go?

263
00:23:03,960 --> 00:23:05,119
Let's part ways here.

264
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:08,519
This time,

265
00:23:10,559 --> 00:23:12,039
it was nice to meet you.

266
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:14,720
I also want to know
where you want to go.

267
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:19,519
I want to know

268
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:25,319
if you really never lie.

269
00:23:30,319 --> 00:23:31,200
No.

270
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:34,160
How can a person not lie?

271
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:18,240
Fang,

272
00:24:18,359 --> 00:24:19,160
who am I?

273
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:19,920
Fang.

274
00:24:25,519 --> 00:24:26,359
Fang.

275
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:32,160
Deputy.

276
00:24:34,359 --> 00:24:35,279
Who am I?

277
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,319
Hou!

278
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:41,759
I tied you up.

279
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,510
I will let you go after we talk.

280
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:49,200
What is there left to say?

281
00:24:49,839 --> 00:24:51,200
What to say?

282
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:53,559
You have killed people.

283
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,952
At 15, you went to guard the frontier.

284
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:57,680
In five years, you fought seven battles.

285
00:24:57,690 --> 00:24:59,319
Seventeen people died under your spear.

286
00:24:59,319 --> 00:25:01,039
That was killing the enemy.

287
00:25:01,039 --> 00:25:02,279
It is not the same!

288
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:03,880
Don't shout.

289
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,200
Speak calmly.

290
00:25:07,599 --> 00:25:08,759
I can hear you.

291
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:13,079
Miss Zhang's

292
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:15,839
27 family members...

293
00:25:17,799 --> 00:25:18,920
Was it you

294
00:25:19,519 --> 00:25:21,319
and Tie Futu who poisoned them?

295
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:23,519
Yes.

296
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:26,200
But you were on the city wall,

297
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:28,279
clearly asking me to protect her

298
00:25:28,599 --> 00:25:29,599
and do

299
00:25:29,759 --> 00:25:30,960
whatever she says.

300
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,480
I want the gold.

301
00:25:33,839 --> 00:25:35,160
300,000 taels.

302
00:25:35,400 --> 00:25:37,759
What do you need the gold for?

303
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:44,510
I don't want to spend
my whole life in the great desert.

304
00:25:46,480 --> 00:25:48,079
I don't want to go out every day

305
00:25:48,080 --> 00:25:49,680
to the scorching sun and yellow sand.

306
00:25:50,599 --> 00:25:51,519
In Jiangnan,

307
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:54,200
there are fireworks and willows.

308
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:56,039
Everything is expensive.

309
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:58,559
Hou,

310
00:25:59,559 --> 00:26:00,759
are you going to leave?

311
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:02,680
I don't want to spend my whole life

312
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:04,640
growing old and dying in this place.

313
00:26:09,759 --> 00:26:12,480
So you killed Miss Zhang's whole family.

314
00:26:13,104 --> 00:26:14,720
So you killed the guardian of the gold!

315
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:15,559
You killed Bana.

316
00:26:15,559 --> 00:26:16,519
Hou!

317
00:26:17,519 --> 00:26:20,440
Doing this, does your conscience
really not bother you?

318
00:26:20,440 --> 00:26:21,440
It doesn't.

319
00:26:22,799 --> 00:26:24,160
You only live once.

320
00:26:25,039 --> 00:26:26,119
A real man

321
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:27,920
must cut ties decisively.

322
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:28,759
I don't believe it.

323
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:31,790
I don't believe it.
You're not that kind of person.

324
00:26:31,799 --> 00:26:32,960
I am that kind of person.

325
00:26:33,079 --> 00:26:34,599
I am that kind of person!

326
00:26:41,079 --> 00:26:42,480
I've told you now.

327
00:26:43,759 --> 00:26:45,920
What will the General
think of you doing this?

328
00:26:46,519 --> 00:26:48,039
Is this how you repay the General?

329
00:26:49,079 --> 00:26:51,119
If you leave,
what will the General think?

330
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:53,079
You once said

331
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:54,720
the General

332
00:26:54,720 --> 00:26:56,119
is like an older brother to you,

333
00:26:56,839 --> 00:26:59,279
just like you are to me, Deputy!

334
00:27:04,519 --> 00:27:06,240
Once you've stood on these city walls

335
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:08,440
for another 20 years,

336
00:27:09,559 --> 00:27:11,319
you'll become just like me.

337
00:27:13,079 --> 00:27:15,079
No amount of torture could make me.

338
00:27:16,759 --> 00:27:18,119
I like those city walls.

339
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,799
I like the great desert.

340
00:27:21,039 --> 00:27:22,680
I like the hot sun.

341
00:27:23,039 --> 00:27:24,160
I like it all.

342
00:27:26,319 --> 00:27:28,359
I won't let you down, Deputy.

343
00:27:41,296 --> 00:27:42,350
Once the rope is untied,

344
00:27:42,359 --> 00:27:43,960
you won't fight me, will you?

345
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:51,160
Not even if I die!

346
00:27:56,359 --> 00:27:57,640
You can leave now.

347
00:27:57,880 --> 00:27:58,799
Don't look back.

348
00:27:59,759 --> 00:28:00,799
Or you can

349
00:28:02,119 --> 00:28:03,279
lie down and get some sleep.

350
00:28:13,039 --> 00:28:14,039
Tomorrow morning,

351
00:28:15,279 --> 00:28:16,680
head toward Shiquan Fort.

352
00:28:17,319 --> 00:28:19,079
The guardians of the gold
will give chase.

353
00:28:20,519 --> 00:28:21,920
You've made enemies of them.

354
00:28:22,440 --> 00:28:23,720
Keep an eye on that kid.

355
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:28,920
Enemies over what?

356
00:28:30,559 --> 00:28:32,000
You killed a guardian of the gold,

357
00:28:33,599 --> 00:28:34,759
who is that kid's father.

358
00:30:07,079 --> 00:30:08,559
How bold of you.

359
00:30:12,590 --> 00:30:15,392
How dare you accuse
the Commander-in-Chief of Gansu

360
00:30:15,456 --> 00:30:16,720
of murder and robbery.

361
00:30:20,319 --> 00:30:22,519
So you want to punish me
for that, Officer Pu?

362
00:30:24,320 --> 00:30:26,240
You can't just throw
wild accusations around.

363
00:30:31,680 --> 00:30:33,640
Just take it as me
spouting nonsense then.

364
00:30:35,232 --> 00:30:37,270
It's not like you can
go question the General.

365
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:40,160
Even if you asked,

366
00:30:41,039 --> 00:30:42,799
what if he denies it?

367
00:30:44,799 --> 00:30:46,400
Even if he admits it,

368
00:30:47,119 --> 00:30:48,759
what can the imperial court do?

369
00:30:51,599 --> 00:30:54,519
It's only natural for him
to want former dynasty gold.

370
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:58,720
My father and brothers
were just commoners.

371
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:02,720
How do you know it was the General?

372
00:31:04,359 --> 00:31:05,519
I just know.

373
00:31:05,839 --> 00:31:07,240
How do you know?

374
00:31:11,759 --> 00:31:13,880
Though I've never met the General,

375
00:31:15,559 --> 00:31:17,240
I know what kind of man

376
00:31:17,240 --> 00:31:18,400
Deputy Yu of Liangzhou is.

377
00:31:20,784 --> 00:31:22,510
Collusion between officials and bandits

378
00:31:25,079 --> 00:31:26,640
was the General's order.

379
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,839
Did Deputy Yu tell you that?

380
00:31:39,319 --> 00:31:40,559
Bancha said

381
00:31:42,839 --> 00:31:45,559
not all hatred can be avenged.

382
00:31:47,759 --> 00:31:49,039
I'm leaving tomorrow.

383
00:31:50,839 --> 00:31:52,039
Where will you go?

384
00:31:54,039 --> 00:31:55,720
Not back to Northern Shu, for sure.

385
00:31:58,160 --> 00:31:59,759
Maybe I'll go

386
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:03,000
to Jiangnan.

387
00:32:08,160 --> 00:32:09,240
What do you mean?

388
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:11,640
This matter isn't over yet.

389
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,279
Go back to the Capital.

390
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:19,200
If you feel this isn't over,

391
00:32:20,039 --> 00:32:22,119
go back and report
to the imperial court.

392
00:32:22,839 --> 00:32:24,240
That would be helping me.

393
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:27,960
The court might send
another imperial envoy

394
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:30,640
who can actually get
the General to tell the truth.

395
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:35,960
If the imperial will is unpredictable
and nothing comes of it,

396
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:38,559
Officer Pu,

397
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:42,160
you must live and act as you did before.

398
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:46,160
Forget everything
that happened in Gansu.

399
00:32:47,759 --> 00:32:49,319
Forget me, too.

400
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:52,599
It's very easy to forget.

401
00:32:56,319 --> 00:32:57,400
That's all?

402
00:33:01,960 --> 00:33:04,160
We'll go our separate ways at dawn,

403
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:07,119
never to meet again in this life.

404
00:33:10,079 --> 00:33:11,200
That's all?

405
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:15,319
You're a good person.

406
00:33:18,279 --> 00:33:20,319
Good people should live a long life.

407
00:33:25,520 --> 00:33:27,264
I never expected it
to turn out like this.

408
00:33:34,839 --> 00:33:35,920
I'm going to sleep.

409
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:40,440
Safe travels at dawn, Officer Pu.

410
00:33:56,319 --> 00:33:57,839
The girl is buried right here?

411
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:06,240
It's the best we can do.

412
00:34:08,576 --> 00:34:10,230
It'll be the same for you when you die?

413
00:34:12,559 --> 00:34:13,840
When I die,

414
00:34:15,280 --> 00:34:16,920
I want to be buried in Wusu Sea.

415
00:34:19,639 --> 00:34:20,840
Bancha said

416
00:34:22,880 --> 00:34:25,400
there is no better place
in this world than Wusu Sea.

417
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:28,360
How good is it?

418
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:31,079
Like heaven.

419
00:34:36,039 --> 00:34:37,320
You won't die.

420
00:37:25,719 --> 00:37:26,679
I'm leaving.

421
00:37:29,039 --> 00:37:30,079
Without you,

422
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:33,719
I have no family left in this world.

423
00:37:36,559 --> 00:37:38,079
Nothing to tie me down,

424
00:37:40,239 --> 00:37:41,400
and nothing to fear.

425
00:39:02,380 --> 00:39:06,740
(Ganzhou)

426
00:39:27,039 --> 00:39:27,719
Move!

427
00:39:27,960 --> 00:39:28,639
Move.

428
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:31,000
Move.

429
00:39:36,320 --> 00:39:37,000
This way.

430
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:46,239
Come take a look.

431
00:40:11,900 --> 00:40:17,140
(Shaquan Inn)

432
00:40:22,000 --> 00:40:22,960
Just one person?

433
00:40:24,840 --> 00:40:26,000
I'm looking for someone.

434
00:40:29,480 --> 00:40:30,559
Who are you looking for?

435
00:40:31,159 --> 00:40:32,480
The person I'm looking for

436
00:40:33,199 --> 00:40:35,360
is staying in your best room.

437
00:42:10,440 --> 00:42:12,960
I'm looking for
Qin Demon of Mount Pingfeng.

438
00:42:13,639 --> 00:42:14,840
Hold on a second.

439
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:17,440
I still think

440
00:42:17,440 --> 00:42:19,320
the water at Mount Pingfeng is better.

441
00:42:20,039 --> 00:42:22,920
Earlier you said,
between Ganzhou and Xining,

442
00:42:23,159 --> 00:42:25,400
this inn in Ganzhou had the best water.

443
00:42:25,968 --> 00:42:28,230
Now, you're back to
praising Mount Pingfeng's water.

444
00:42:30,239 --> 00:42:31,960
Qin Demon wanted to bathe?

445
00:42:32,159 --> 00:42:33,159
He made me

446
00:42:33,880 --> 00:42:36,599
come all the way to Ganzhou to see him.

447
00:42:37,559 --> 00:42:39,480
You're unhappy every time you come out.

448
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:40,760
And everything costs so much.

449
00:43:04,079 --> 00:43:05,199
Which of you

450
00:43:05,519 --> 00:43:07,679
is the Qin Demon of Mount Pingfeng?

451
00:43:12,540 --> 00:43:14,980
(Preview of the Next Episode)

452
00:43:15,440 --> 00:43:16,199
What sorcery

453
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:17,639
does this guqin have?

454
00:43:23,239 --> 00:43:24,360
Who killed Bana?

455
00:43:24,639 --> 00:43:25,159
I did.

456
00:43:25,840 --> 00:43:27,800
Let me show you what I've got.

457
00:43:28,320 --> 00:43:29,039
Form up.

458
00:43:29,040 --> 00:43:29,760
Divine machinery.

459
00:43:34,039 --> 00:43:34,920
Tie Futu,

460
00:43:35,480 --> 00:43:37,719
the superior officer
ordered your arrest.

461
00:43:38,320 --> 00:43:40,920
Surrender at once.

462
00:43:42,761 --> 00:43:47,761
=Remnants of Gold=
